requirements osha_penalties v1
description "Where the amounts of osha_penalty.rule come from: 29 CFR 1903.15(d), the section the rule pins."

role maintainer "Reads the section against the rule, and keeps the module"

source osha = rulec "osha_penalty.rule" source osha

scope rulec "osha_penalty.rule" table

requirement penalty_amounts
  text "For penalties proposed after January 15, 2024, the penalty for a willful violation is at least $11,524 and at most $161,323, and for a repeated violation at most $161,323. The penalty for a serious violation, an other-than-serious violation or a posting requirement violation is at most $16,131, and for a failure to correct a violation at most $16,131 per day."
  in force 2024-01-16..
  owner maintainer
  from @osha "§1903.15"
    reviewed 2026-11-05 by maintainer sha256:b8b38d7b2786bc9a -> sha256:339f29f8a2a98a9e
  decided 2026-11-05 by maintainer "Follows the amendment at 89 FR 1817 (January 11, 2024), which states the adjusted amounts for penalties proposed after January 15, 2024."
  satisfied by rulec "osha_penalty.rule" table amounts
    reviewed 2026-11-05 by maintainer sha256:339f29f8a2a98a9e -> sha256:b165de089838f476
  verified by rulec "osha_penalty.rule"
    reviewed 2026-11-05 by maintainer sha256:339f29f8a2a98a9e -> sha256:93fea094d0b3049d
